canon = "Ch21 (Keeper, [C]): NOT in the kitchen: walking to her painting room she meets him in a moonlit hallway, masked, crowned with laurel. 'Going somewhere?' He pins her to the wall, claws punch into the wall, he bites to hold her; the teeth don't pierce. She: 'don't bite me like some enraged beast.' No slap in canon: her E is pushing him off. Restraint: the camera stays with her, the screen nearly dark, no close-up of the bite."
